VALUES (32673, 'tt0000465', NULL, 'The Kingdom of the Fairies', 'Le Royaume des fées', 'movie', 1903, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MgxM4zp5pCKHe8sDFVygb696xK.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a8Lx6fd8A1x7maSZfl52s5717QY.jpg', 'At the royal court, a prince is presenting the princess whom he is pledged to marry when a witch suddenly appears. Though driven off, the witch soon returns, summons some of her servants, and carries off the princess. A rescue party is quickly organized, but the unfortunate captive has been taken to a strange, forbidding realm, from where it will be impossible to rescue her without some special help.', NULL, NULL, 1.2244, 6.9, 0, 9.01, '2026-09-17 03:31:35', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
