VALUES (951164, 'tt19747800', NULL, 'How to Save a Dead Friend', 'Как спасти мёртвого друга', 'movie', 2023, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tw6PQLBjnsHEiFY38QAAqQ7MtrG.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/29VBrcCbYG4G2Do3xo6ARAXtbg3.jpg', 'Marusya is 16 and, like many Russian teenagers, is determined to end her life. Then she meets her soulmate in another millennial, Kimi. They spend a decade filming the euphoria and anxiety, the happiness and misery of their youth, muzzled by a violent and autocratic regime in the midst of a “depressed Russia”. This film is a cry from the heart, a tribute to an entire silenced generation.', NULL, NULL, 1.3841, 6.25, 0, 9.0, '2026-09-17 03:31:35', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
