VALUES (10472, 'tt0186975', NULL, 'Down to You', 'Down to You', 'movie', 2000, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqEEtX4S8j2XqZ9JAD97fz2DPkV.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kqcbwRrUmkcUe6TcFWHMnobVDon.jpg', 'College coeds in New York City, Al, the son of a celebrity chef, and Imogen, a talented artist, become smitten the second they lay eyes on one another at a bar. However, the road to happiness is not a smooth one. Outside forces, including a predatory porn star who wants to lure Al into her bed, threaten to pull apart the young lovers before their romance has a chance to really flourish.', NULL, NULL, 3.7513, 5.2, 0, 8.0, '2026-09-17 03:31:35', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
