VALUES (10029, 'tt0124198', NULL, 'Very Bad Things', 'Very Bad Things', 'movie', 1998, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYmyRxF5e9fBdgcQScKu0CUtMy5.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2hrgzOj35M3Fa3YFWiaAD2Ty6Hu.jpg', 'Kyle Fisher has one last night to celebrate life as a single man before marrying Laura, so he sets out to Vegas with four of his best buddies. But a drug and alcohol filled night on the town with a stripper who goes all the way, turns into a cold night in the desert with shovels when the stripper goes all the way into a body bag after dying in their bathroom. And that''s just the first of the bodies to pile up before Kyle can walk down the aisle...', NULL, NULL, 3.2207, 6.282, 0, 1.01, '2026-09-17 03:31:35', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
