VALUES (9067, 'tt0114614', NULL, 'Tank Girl', 'Tank Girl', 'movie', 1995, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpX63vJd6k5fMTudLaEOw9ffX8h.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rmG0rboJMA9sE6vttQCM2eXXJ2Q.jpg', 'After a comet disrupts the rain cycle of Earth, the planet has become a desolate, barren desert by the year 2033. With resources scarce, Kesslee, head of the powerful and evil Water & Power Corporation, the de facto government, has taken control of the water supply. Unwilling to cower under Kesslee''s tyrannical rule, a pair of outlaws known as Tank Girl and Jet Girl rise up, joining the mysterious rebel Rippers to destroy the corrupt system.', NULL, NULL, 3.6558, 5.494, 0, 5.13760416666666657e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
