VALUES (30959, 'tt0058279', NULL, 'Kwaidan', '怪談', 'movie', 1965, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9UMfViYl47SdZZatKQ1JKjjCgs.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9GAU0z2wVA8M2D2w36CaloWYYgv.jpg', 'Taking its title from an archaic Japanese word meaning "ghost story," this anthology adapts four folk tales. A penniless samurai marries for money with tragic results. A man stranded in a blizzard is saved by Yuki the Snow Maiden, but his rescue comes at a cost. Blind musician Hoichi is forced to perform for an audience of ghosts. An author relates the story of a samurai who sees another warrior''s reflection in his teacup.', NULL, NULL, 2.8456, 7.705, 0, 2.7385454545454543e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
