VALUES (5488, 'tt0497137', NULL, 'I''m a Cyborg, But That''s OK', '싸이보그지만 괜찮아', 'movie', 2006, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uDGx2lzjROf3335CGKdCYs6WD5.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eLgZPEG4994T2gjB1YtgQJrp8b3.jpg', 'Young-goon, mentally deranged and frequently electro-charging herself with a transistor radio, has been admitted into a mental institution. Firmly believing herself to be a cyborg, she refuses to consume like a human being. Il-soon is another patient, who catches the eye of Young-goon and soon becomes a close friend. Il-soon is now confronted with the biggest task: to cure Young-goon''s mental problem and have her eat real food.', NULL, NULL, 2.3234, 7.047, 0, 1.42433333333333322e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
