VALUES (762361, 'tt13515090', NULL, 'Joyride', 'Joyride', 'movie', 2022, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0zaMNacZdm5CAU484hb8fmJs6j.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qQfpXqKR6dewogmh3D6T0hFy3CE.jpg', '12-year-old Mully has lost his mother and discovers his debt-ridden father stealing the charity money they''ve raised in her name. Grabbing the cash, Mully steals a taxi and is shocked to find a woman, Joy, in the back seat with a baby. A straight-talking solicitor who didn''t expect to get pregnant, Joy is struggling with motherhood and planning to give her baby to a friend who will raise the child as her own. She joins Mully on a wild journey across Ireland, stealing cars, hitch-hiking, catching ferries and breaking police barricades.', NULL, NULL, 2.1069, 5.9, 0, 1.13533333333333335e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
