VALUES (82695, 'tt1707386', NULL, 'Les Misérables', 'Les Misérables', 'movie', 2012, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CuzBs2Lb8At7qQr64mLXg2RYRb.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bsG8LkZx1ijrcf3fP6AvBlGTxkX.jpg', 'An adaptation of the successful stage musical based on Victor Hugo''s classic novel set in 19th-century France. Jean Valjean, a man imprisoned for stealing bread, must flee a relentless policeman named Javert. The pursuit consumes both men''s lives, and soon Valjean finds himself in the midst of the student revolutions in France.', NULL, NULL, 11.0806, 7.294, 0, 9.93666666666666564e+00, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
