VALUES (25904, 'tt0063278', NULL, 'Marketa Lazarová', 'Marketa Lazarová', 'movie', 1967, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBf0N1kNQGr6btlO9F66VAV1moz.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1Vbd0TVNZXlzTlyLkYnOMzpq1eH.jpg', 'Mikolás and his brother Adam end up with a young German hostage of noble blood during a robbery. While their clan prepares for the wrath of the German king, Mikolás is sent to pressure his neighbor Lazar into a defense pact. Persuasion fails and he abducts Lazar''s daughter Marketa on the eve of her initiation as a nun in an act of vengeance.', NULL, NULL, 2.3913, 7.8, 0, 1.83226666666666666e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
