VALUES (275, 'tt0116282', NULL, 'Fargo', 'Fargo', 'movie', 1996, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rt7cpEr1uP6RTZykBFhBTcRaKvG.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/747dgDfL5d8esobk7h4odaOFhUq.jpg', 'Jerry, a small-town Minnesota car salesman is bursting at the seams with debt... but he''s got a plan. He''s going to hire two thugs to kidnap his wife in a scheme to collect a hefty ransom from his wealthy father-in-law. It''s going to be a snap and nobody''s going to get hurt... until people start dying. Enter Police Chief Marge, a coffee-drinking, parka-wearing - and extremely pregnant - investigator who''ll stop at nothing to get her man. And if you think her small-time investigative skills will give the crooks a run for their ransom... you betcha!', NULL, NULL, 10.351, 7.8, 0, 5.42637254901960801e+01, '2026-07-20 01:02:04', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
