VALUES (5121, 'tt0072226', NULL, 'The Sugarland Express', 'The Sugarland Express', 'movie', 1974, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csahjHhtJ9NzFKcxVcw7S4Pyfj.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cssKLoKClpgqaaGD2z3cjXgzPSM.jpg', 'Married small-time crooks Lou-Jean and Clovis Poplin lose their baby to the state of Texas and resolve to do whatever it takes to get him back. Lou-Jean gets Clovis out of jail, and the two steal their son from his foster home, in addition to taking a highway patrolman hostage. As a massive dragnet starts to pursue them across Texas, the couple become unlikely folk heroes and even start to bond with the captive policeman.', NULL, NULL, 2.7035, 6.609, 0, 3.01, '2026-07-21 03:32:24', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
