VALUES (1447, 'tt0491738', NULL, 'Psych', 'Psych', 'tv', 2006, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDI15gTVbtW5Sbv5QenqecRxWKJ.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sh7GRlX4d7j3XSTeyGZnlKqkHGk.jpg', 'Thanks to his police officer father''s efforts, Shawn Spencer spent his childhood developing a keen eye for detail (and a lasting dislike of his dad). Years later, Shawn''s frequent tips to the police lead to him being falsely accused of a crime he solved.

Now, Shawn has no choice but to use his abilities to perpetuate his cover story: psychic crime-solving powers, all the while dragging his best friend, his dad, and the police along for the ride.', NULL, NULL, 74.6785, 7.889, 0, 6.13666666666666671e+00, '2026-07-31 03:33:23', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
