VALUES (10161, 'tt0097937', NULL, 'My Left Foot: The Story of Christy Brown', 'My Left Foot: The Story of Christy Brown', 'movie', 1989, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GRAAl0bMQFoFIjV3aunc5jsM5u.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zjKg04EquTcnVZUfjHboXnXzjcF.jpg', 'No one expects much from Christy Brown, a boy with cerebral palsy born into a working-class Irish family. Though Christy is a spastic quadriplegic and essentially paralyzed, a miraculous event occurs when, at the age of 5, he demonstrates control of his left foot by using chalk to scrawl a word on the floor. With the help of his steely mother — and no shortage of grit and determination — Christy overcomes his infirmity to become a painter, poet and author.', NULL, NULL, 3.8441, 7.531, 0, 1.22257142857142859e+01, '2026-08-03 14:31:56', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
