VALUES (61585, 'tt3012698', NULL, 'Olive Kitteridge', 'Olive Kitteridge', 'tv', 2014, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tuB2kGd4is7tFMhcOTfEGB96lm.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/txEVdfRT16eT97zpKXqWKrc5UXO.jpg', 'A look at a seemingly placid New England town that is actually wrought with illicit affairs, crime and tragedy, all told through the lens of Olive, whose wicked wit and harsh demeanor mask a warm but troubled heart and staunch moral center. The story spans 25 years and focuses on Olive''s relationships with her husband, Henry, the good-hearted and kindly town pharmacist; their son, Christopher, who resents his mother''s approach to parenting; and other members of their community.', NULL, NULL, 3.6868, 7.592, 0, 5.012, '2026-08-03 14:31:56', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
