VALUES (31589, 'tt0054460', NULL, 'The Bad Sleep Well', '悪い奴ほどよく眠る', 'movie', 1960, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0LhZ121uaqa31RUeu1mOnaFb5w.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m9NzvzYugcjkkZ5A3WdQhI3Mbe7.jpg', 'In this loose adaptation of "Hamlet," illegitimate son Kôichi Nishi climbs to a high position within a Japanese corporation and marries the crippled daughter of company vice president Iwabuchi. At the reception, the wedding cake is a replica of their corporate headquarters, but an aspect of the design reminds the party of the hushed-up death of Nishi''s father. It is then that Nishi unleashes his plan to avenge his father''s death.', NULL, NULL, 2.5089, 7.715, 0, 6.52, '2026-08-09 02:29:31', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
