VALUES (11940, 'tt0076716', NULL, 'Sinbad and the Eye of the Tiger', 'Sinbad and the Eye of the Tiger', 'movie', 1977, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMP5bg26ac1FmNCamOC5WZece6N.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bJpDvcc2um0g2EA1vr8XlXHgkFk.jpg', 'Princess Farah refuses to marry Sinbad until Prince Kassim, her brother, is able to give his consent. However, the Prince''s wicked stepmother, Queen Zenobia, has changed Kassim into a baboon in order to have her own son crowned as caliph. Sinbad, his crew, the Princess and the transformed Prince travel to a distant land, fighting every obstacle Zenobia places in their path, to seek the advice of a legendary wise man who can possibly tell how to end the spell.', NULL, NULL, 3.305, 6.576, 0, 6.34333333333333282e+00, '2026-08-09 02:29:31', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
