VALUES (71, 'tt0249462', NULL, 'Billy Elliot', 'Billy Elliot', 'movie', 2000, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mYtqgWCJiXpDeZwjVcC3OQGD8IR.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/urzflyf41uySpgciGHdQzpcaMOY.jpg', 'County Durham, England, 1984. The miners'' strike has started and the police have started coming up from Bethnal Green, starting a class war with the lower classes suffering. Caught in the middle of the conflict is 11-year old Billy Elliot, who, after leaving his boxing club for the day, stumbles upon a ballet class and finds out that he''s naturally talented. He practices with his teacher Mrs. Wilkinson for an upcoming audition in Newcastle-upon Tyne for the royal Ballet school in London.', NULL, NULL, 5.3437, 7.597, 0, 1.19733333333333327e+01, '2026-08-19 01:49:52', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
