VALUES (75011, 'tt0065908', NULL, 'How I Unleashed World War II, Part I: The Escape', 'Jak rozpętałem drugą wojnę światową: Cz. 1 - Ucieczka', 'movie', 1970, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2smM51Pz6Bt2jjabd7UPyVkM4wu.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gujTminHou8yfdVhJxn4wiGuTpR.jpg', 'On the night of August 31, 1939, Dolas, from a platoon reinforcing a train station on the German border, falls asleep in a train car and unknowingly crosses into Germany. The moment he shoots a German, who he thinks is a saboteur, the German invasion of Poland begins, and Dolas is convinced it was his fault. He is taken to Stalag POW camp, the first destination in his odyssey around Europe.', NULL, NULL, 1.1089, 7.6, 0, 6.51, '2026-08-21 01:43:43', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
