VALUES (1720, 'tt0351461', NULL, 'Noi the Albino', 'Nói albínói', 'movie', 2003, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dy8srjJ3pQCA967wcJ2WaaTbr51.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2verdecl3RVgi25DCi9LgynSJtF.jpg', '17 year old Nói drifts through life on a remote fjord in Iceland. In winter, the fjord is cut off from the outside world, surrounded by ominous mountains and buried under a shroud of snow. Nói dreams of escaping from this white-walled prison with Íris, a city girl who works in a local gas station. But his clumsy attempts at escape spiral out of control.', NULL, NULL, 1.3505, 7.0, 0, 6.52, '2026-08-26 01:43:46', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
