VALUES (209185, 'tt2319580', NULL, 'The Grand Seduction', 'The Grand Seduction', 'movie', 2014, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEmeM9BKYWaCxzX0nF6thqLl9zp.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wUG2O57Rg0hrMtwsL6b9etPkKAD.jpg', 'A small fishing village must procure a local doctor to secure a lucrative business contract. When unlikely candidate and big city doctor Paul Lewis lands in their lap for a trial residence, the townsfolk rally together to charm him into staying. As the doctor’s time in the village winds to a close, acting mayor Murray French has no choice but to pull out all the stops and begin The Grand Seduction.', NULL, NULL, 2.5857, 6.684, 0, 6.38, '2026-08-26 01:43:46', '2026-09-17 03:31:35')
